                            Module = "complete-words",
                            Position = 3,
                            PublicationStatus = 2,
                            Text = "Much of the water people use is stored beneath the ground. After {{1}} falls {{2}} water {{3}} through {{4}} spaces {{5}} rocks {{6}} underground {{7}} slowly {{8}} and {{9}} this {{10}} resource. These layers can supply wells even during dry weather. Yet the stored water is not unlimited. If people pump it out faster than rainfall replaces it, the water level drops. Understanding this balance helps communities decide how much water they can safely use for farming and household needs.",
