                            Text = "Honeybees share information about food with other members of their colony. A {{1}} returns {{2}} after {{3}} flowers {{4}} performs {{5}} that {{6}} direction {{7}} other {{8}} watch {{9}} receive {{10}} information. The pattern gives nearby workers clues about where they should search. The message is not a map with exact coordinates. Wind, the quality of the food, and the distance from the colony can affect a bee's journey. Researchers observe repeated trips to understand how the colony responds to changing conditions.",
