                            Module = "complete-words",
                            Position = 5,
                            PublicationStatus = 2,
                            Text = "Archaeologists use ordinary objects to investigate how people lived in the past. Broken {{1}} often {{2}} more {{3}} daily {{4}} than {{5}} objects {{6}} common {{7}} reflect {{8}} shared {{9}} many {{10}} people. A cooking pot may contain traces of food, while worn surfaces can show how an object was handled. Researchers record where each piece was found before removing it. An object loses part of its value as evidence when the relationship between it and the surrounding materials is unknown.",
