                            Module = "complete-words",
                            Position = 7,
                            PublicationStatus = 2,
                            Text = "An oral history archive preserves accounts that may never appear in official records. Local {{1}} interview {{2}} residents {{3}} changing {{4}} and {{5}} their {{6}} while {{7}} historians {{8}} these {{9}} with {{10}} documents. A remembered date may be inaccurate even when a description of everyday routines is valuable. Interviewers therefore ask open questions and avoid suggesting the answer they expect. The recordings retain the speakers' own words. Together with maps and letters, these accounts help future listeners understand how different people experienced the same changes.",
